BR05 initial read-only result collector failed after bundletool/ZIP/resource checks:
TypeError: object of type 'function' has no len()
Root cause: payload_entries used len(payload) on the local helper instead of its map.
This is evidence-collector bookkeeping, not signing/product failure. Existing key,
unsigned/signed outputs were retained; no second key generation or signing occurred.
The collector was corrected and rerun read-only.
